(7732961, 1274240, 75585, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> dont know why you didnt think it would go well .. its a stunning portrait .. and perfect for the challenge .. fortunately there were lots of ppl who were very appreciative .. sorta makes up for the less than amazing finish .. i truly feel its so much better than some that beat you .. just my opinion .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My work tends to be voted low by participants; and knew that this would be the same.  Not always, but very often.  That is all. On the final day of voting I can count on a .3 to .6 drop and this was about a .45 - it is what it is.</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: dont know why you didnt think it would go well .. its a stunning portrait .. and perfect for the challenge .. fortunately there were lots of ppl who were very appreciative .. sorta makes up for the less than amazing finish .. i truly feel its so much better than some that beat you .. just my opinion .. :)   My work tends to be voted low by participants; and knew that this would be the same.  Not always, but very often.  That is all. On the final day of voting I can count on a .3 to .6 drop and this was about a .45 - it is what it is.', '2022-11-18 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
